From 72338600007e876465cb37819cd1a7b1c822261f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:23:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(keyword-audit): compare against real competitor URLs
 instead of a fixed keyword list

Competitor gaps used to be the same 12 digital-marketing phrases for every site. The keyword
audit now takes up to 3 competitor URLs, crawls up to 10 pages of each, and lists two-word
phrases they use at least twice that the audited site never mentions. With no competitors the
area is marked N/A and left out of the overall score. Older reports' gaps are hidden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
